      "updated": 1783679244646,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The ALU itself has 2 input. One is\nD register and the other\nis either M or A. If I look at some\nof the comp, there are 2 branches\nbetween them:\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 16.62390376975258,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The ALU itself has 2 input. One is D register and the other\nis either M or A. If I look at some of the comp, there are 2 branches\nbetween them:\n\n ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
